      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To avoid this bug, but also to avoid flipping again when the bug is fixed, the colors of each pixel is obtained with `Texture2D.GetPixels()`, and only when an inversion is detected, `Texture2D.SetPixels()` and `Texture2D.Apply()` are used to flip the texture up or down.\n\nhttps://github.com/vr-lifemagazine/wall-newspaper-asset/commit/75eb13cefd7b7291b35f34e7a48c84add83ba542#diff-2e4dff698e5068f678f95b2c0ba644330c539fc84341e03223a2ac100489ba7e\n\nThis workaround, however, can only be used if a texture has areas that do not change color when updated and change color when flipped upside down.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
